# The collaborative text (build.md + Markdown sources) must be LF: CodeMirror and
# the Yjs Y.Text are LF-only, and CRLF desyncs the editor from the shared text
# (scrambling edits). The server also normalizes on read, but keeping the repo's
# own files LF avoids reintroducing CRLF via git core.autocrlf on Windows.
*.md text eol=lf
